    "sentence_translations": [
      "A Small Slip of Paper",
      "",
      "One day, Little Wang saw an extremely beautiful girl on the bus, and he really wanted to get to know her.",
      "",
      "So he thought of an idea.",
      "He quietly handed her a small slip of paper with the message: Can I add you on WeChat?",
      "If you agree, please pass the slip of paper back. If not, then please throw it out of the window!",
      "",
      "After a while, the girl really handed the slip of paper back.",
      "Little Wang was very happy, but when he opened the slip of paper, he saw that on top it was written:",
      "Sorry, I couldn’t open the window. Also, littering is wrong!",
      ""
    ]
  }
